{"unit_id":"cckyros__goal-acceptance#card-zh","repo":"cckyros/goal-acceptance","commit":"9a8858fcc9f09d4cc6e8247333ab627c383ed7fb","type":"card","lang":"zh","text":"goal-acceptance（DSH 插件）：为目标建立可验证的验收标准，帮助 agent 按证据判断工作是否完成。它在 DeepSeek Harness 中注册目标验收服务、模型工具和系统提示，并在回合即将结束时检查必需标准；标准仍待处理时，可按依赖顺序提示 agent 继续。主要功能包括锁定与补充标准、记录验证状态和证据、管理关联任务计划、检查完成条件，以及在有限次数内自动续推。适合需要把复杂目标拆成可追踪交付条件的 DSH 工作流。可配置自动续推开关和每个会话的最大续推次数；源码显示插件配置有默认值，不要求额外 API key。","source":"generated","evidence":["src/plugin/dsh-plugin.ts:60-68","src/plugin/dsh-plugin.ts:973-1047","src/plugin/engine/engine.ts:1-80"]}
{"unit_id":"cckyros__goal-acceptance#card-en","repo":"cckyros/goal-acceptance","commit":"9a8858fcc9f09d4cc6e8247333ab627c383ed7fb","type":"card","lang":"en","text":"goal-acceptance tracks DSH goal criteria with evidence. It registers tools and prompt guidance, checks required work when a turn stops, and can steer agents to dependency-ready tasks. It supports task plans and completion checks. Steering settings have defaults; no API key is required.","source":"generated","evidence":["src/plugin/dsh-plugin.ts:60-68","src/plugin/dsh-plugin.ts:973-1047","src/plugin/engine/engine.ts:1-80"]}
